# Strands Agent Environment Configuration
#
# This agent uses the project's centralized environment files:
#   - env/public/.env.development (local development)
#   - env/public/.env.production (production/AgentCore)
#
# Run with dotenvx:
#   ./run.sh                    # Development mode
#   ./run.sh production         # Production mode
#
# Key FLEX_AGENT_* variables (set in project env files):
#   FLEX_AGENT_PORT       - Agent port (default: 8061)
#   FLEX_AGENT_PATH       - AG-UI base path (/ local, /invocations AgentCore)
#   COPILOTKIT_AGENT_ID   - Agent ID (default: ape_assistant)
